      "title": "Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee",
      "description": "Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee - Academic Personnel & Faculty Skip to content All the UW Current site Search scope All the UW Current site Enter search text University of Washington University of Washington UW HR Workday Employee Help UW Finance Faculty Senate Menu Home About us About Us Our Strategic Plan Leadership Team Office and Team Contacts Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee News News eDigest Archive For Academic Personnel For Academic Personnel & Faculty New Faculty @UW Faculty Development Faculty Inclusive Excellence ADVANCE Center for Institutional Change Faculty Review Resources Faculty Promotion & Tenure Librarian Reappointment & Promotion Academic Responsibilities Voting Guidelines Time Off and Leaves Postdoctoral Scholars Affairs & Operations Academic Personnel & Faculty Affairs Academic Titles and Ranks Resources Forms and Templates Policies and Procedures Appointment Actions Visas Academic Jobs Academic Personnel & Faculty Academic Personnel & Faculty About Us Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee The FAAC serves as the advisory board to Faculty Affairs in the UW Tri-Campus System. The Committee primarily focuses on operations and procedures regarding faculty affairs throughout the UW Tri-Campus system. FAAC provides overall direction, priority setting, guidance for process improvement and development of new initiatives and programming. During meetings, the advisory committee discusses: implementation strategies, best practices, and other issues related to faculty development, promotion, merit and unit adjustment, faculty annual reviews, excellence, equity, and assist in the communication process by sharing information discussed at college/school, and campus levels. The inaugural chair of FAAC is Deepa Rao and Trish Kritek is the co-chair. The committee meets once a month. FAAC representatives College/School/Campus / Services Representatives Arts & Sciences, College of Maya Smith Associate Dean for Equity, Justice and Inclusion mayaas@uw.edu Built Environments, College of Ann Marie Borys Associate Dean for Academic Affairs amborys@uw.edu Dentistry, School of Whasun Chung Associate Dean for Faculty sochung@uw.edu Education, College of Carol Davis Associate Dean for Academic Affairs cadavis1@uw.edu Engineering, College of Aileen Trilles Senior Director of Human Resources avt@uw.edu The Environment, College of Stephanie Harrington Associate Dean for Administration and Finance stephah@u w.edu Evans School of Public Policy and Governance David F. Suarez Associate Dean for Research dsuarez@uw.edu u Foster School of Business Jennifer Koski Associate Dean for Academic and Faculty Affairs jkoski@uw.edu Information School Katie Davis Associate Dean for Faculty Affairs kdavis78@uw.edu Law, School of Elizabeth Pendo Associate Dean for Academic Administration ependo@uw.edu Libraries Laura Lillard Director of Libraries Human Resources lill@uw.edu Medicine, School of Giana Davidson, Interim Vice Dean for Faculty Affairs ghd@uw.edu Ashlee Harty, Associate Dean for Academic Affairs and Medical Staff Affairs hartya@uw.edu Nursing, School of Hilaire Thompson Dean of Nursing hilairet@uw.edu Pharmacy, School of Jing Li Associate Professor jli0321@uw.edu Public Health, School of Stephanie Farquhar Associate Dean for Faculty farqs@uw.edu Social Work, School of Jennie Romich Associate Dean for Academic Affairs romich@uw.edu UW Bothell Wadiya Udell Assistant Vice Chancellor for Faculty Success wau2@uw.edu UW Tacoma Sarah Davies Breen Director of Faculty Affairs & Academic Human Resources sdaviesb@uw.edu × Home About Us Our Strategic Plan Leadership Team Fredrick M. Nafukho, PhD, MDP Marjorie Olmstead, PhD Deepa Rao, PhD Chadwick Allen, PhD Office and Team Contacts Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee University of Washington Be boundless Connect with us: Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Pinterest Accessibility Contact Us Jobs Campus Safety My UW Rules Docket Privacy Term